{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123123148864-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123134435\"/><p>拖車翻側橫亘兩行車線上。</p><p>獅子山隧道發生交通意外。今日(23日)早上11時24分，一輛拖車沿路往九龍方向行駛，期間失控撞向右邊牆身石壆後向左翻側，橫亘兩行車線上。隧道職員見狀報案求助。救援人員接報到場前，司機及乘客已自行爬出車外待援，受意外影響往九龍方向管道一度全線封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:29.099186+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:31:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:33.192145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:48.449631+00:00","content_hash":"e272c02bf0afe4f01a2a98dc7d84aa4999f2e2c58ae4bf7bc74f612e1f5420e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}